librptadviax2 (0.1.0~alpha11) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add configured provider registration, authenticated incoming calls and
    outgoing calls on the same listener, with exact account-generation ownership.
  * Preserve genuine receive age through bounded media queues and expose a sized
    timed-poll tail with explicit downstream media-retirement acknowledgments.
  * Add deadline-bound G.711 phone transmission using Mini frames and reliable
    empty codec markers, with independent egress retirement and expiry results.
  * Preserve numeric ASL behavior and verify the public C ABI, both G.711 modes,
    registration, rejection, media and cleanup against an independent Asterisk.
  * Update the pinned Tokio dependency to 1.54.1 while retaining Rust 1.85.

 -- Chris Peterson <cpeter1207@users.noreply.github.com>  Tue, 10 Nov 2026 12:40:00 +0000

